@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p>This page was created as part of the migration to ASP.NET Core MVC.</p>

<p>Use this page to detail your site's privacy policy.</p>

<p>When you use our application, we collect certain information about your activity, device, and browser. This information helps us improve our services and provide a better user experience.</p>

<h2>Information We Collect</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Personal information you provide (name, email address, contact details)</li>
    <li>Booking and reservation data</li>
    <li>Log data and usage statistics</li>
    <li>Device and browser information</li>
</ul>

<h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
<ul>
    <li>To provide and maintain our services</li>
    <li>To process hotel reservations and bookings</li>
    <li>To improve our website functionality and user experience</li>
    <li>To communicate with you about your bookings and account</li>
</ul>

<p>Last updated: @DateTime.Now.ToString("MMMM yyyy")</p>